silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_02_eight_corners_atlas_concrete_anchor_6#corner_110 silm:hasLongDescription "The Corner_110 is [physical, individual, classification]: vet classifying one specific physical cat -- Mittens as DomesticCat at the vet clinic. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Corner_110', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
